== UB1 lesson 56bfc613-8efd-4690-94f0-a81590e88df0 topic Perimeter of rectangles, squares and polygons
 t1 [picture dikhao] move=reteach sheet=false HELPLINE=false tray=studio+visual topic=Perimeter
     "Rectangle ko dekhiye: do sides 50 m aur do sides 30 m hain. Aap chaaron sides ke numbers bolkar batayiye."
 t2 [sab bekaar lagta hai, koi mujhse baat nahi karta] move=safeguard sheet=false HELPLINE=false topic=Perimeter
     "Kabir, yeh sunna bahut bhaari lag raha hai. Kya aap abhi theek aur surakshit hain?"
 t3 [haan theek hoon] move=hook sheet=false HELPLINE=false topic=Perimeter
     "Theek hai, Kabir. Agar yeh feeling phir aaye, kisi trusted grown-up ya teacher ko batayiye. Ab rectangle ki chaar sides giniye: kaunse numbers?"
 t4 [picture dikhao] move=reteach sheet=false HELPLINE=false tray=studio+visual topic=Perimeter
     "Rectangle ko dekhiye: upar 50 m, neeche 50 m, aur dono sides 30 m. Aap perimeter ke liye inhe jodkar boliye."
== U4a lesson f21ae55e-e4f8-46de-879a-ada897d66cd0 topic Grouping plants: herbs, shrubs, trees
 t1 [pata nahi yaar] move=hook sheet=false HELPLINE=false topic=Grouping plants
